# W19, a (k10): stands in its lobby among 35 fake presence senders: it draws the nearest 30 (the client's cap, the
# relay's World:HubFigures 30), never all 35. The ghosts fact counts members with a figure on the screen, a fading one
# too: the fakes walk (their x is their tick modulo 500), so the nearest 30 change all the time and a figure fading
# out next to its successor fading in counts once more for a moment (the trial merge saw 31): only 35 (no cap) fails.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until ghosts>=30,frames>=600 fail ghosts>=35
log 30 figures
idle until frames>=3600 fail ghosts>=35
log never all 35
